Z||000016||broys||08-03-2001||03:16 AM||||I'm reading it alright. I am the one and only...COW-ORKER. He couldn't bribe that Ashville Police Officer with food because that was MY FOOD! They made him ride in the back of the cruiser, that's why there wasn't any cup holders. Matt and the officer both forgot to get the keys so now the police have the keys and they have the car...I wonder what a bored small town police officer does when he has the keys to an impounded fiero...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||6
